---
source: core/src/orchestrator/tests/mod.rs
expression: tool_to_json(&tool)
---
description: "Reactivate a previously deactivated Wasm skill. The skill is reloaded from its compiled Wasm into the sandbox and becomes available again. Only works for skills in 'deactivated' status."
name: reactivate_skill
parameters:
  properties:
    skill_name:
      description: Name of the deactivated skill to reactivate
      type: string
  required:
    - skill_name
  type: object
